Reference data (anime/media ID mappings)
-----------------------------------------
The ID-mapping datasets mirrored under this repository's Releases are derived
from third-party open datasets (including Fribb/anime-lists and the
manami-project anime-offline-database) plus Watchario's own enrichment overlay.
The upstream data remains under its original license; please consult those
projects for terms. Watchario's enrichment additions are provided "AS IS" for
convenience, with no warranty and no guarantee of accuracy or availability.

